+    EGL_BAD_ATTRIBUTE is generated. EGL_IOSURFACE_PLANE_ANGLE is ignored. The
+    pbuffer covers the whole <buffer>: EGL_WIDTH and EGL_HEIGHT must be equal
+    to the width and height of the first plane, swapped if
+    EGL_IOSURFACE_ORIENTATION_ANGLE contains
+    EGL_IOSURFACE_ORIENTATION_SWAP_XY_ANGLE, otherwise EGL_BAD_ATTRIBUTE is
+    generated.
